    "long_instructions": "## AI as a Hospital Triage Nurse\r\n\r\n**1. Attach Resources:** Click [_Add File_] and then [_From Library_]. Select PDF file that contains information about the patients and click [_Attach_].\r\n\r\n**2. Ask :** Interview the AI Chatbot to determine which patients it would prioritize and why.\r\n\r\n**3. Document:** Find the section in your Activity Guide called \"AI’s Selections\" and answer the questions.\r\n",
